      "text": "LangChain Classifier\nMCP Server\n(Python — port 8765)\n\nFastMCP + LCEL\n\nStage 1:\njunk / spam / ads\nnewsletters → discard\n\nStage 2:\npayment / meeting\njob / reply / urgent\n+ summary + urgency\n\nDefault: Claude Haiku\n(set ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)",
